40
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:09,300
Don't worry about it.

41
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,680
It even has a fax function?

42
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,020
It can also work as a printer.

43
00:02:16,020 --> 00:02:18,060
I can't believe you've got
a randoseru this amazing.

44
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:19,800
