45
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,720
My name is Denkyoku Plus.

46
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:24,720
My father is the president
of Super Denshi Kogi.

47
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:29,454
What? The one that's getting the most
attention in electronics right now,

48
00:02:29,504 --> 00:02:30,480
