49
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:33,040
So you're the rich kid of
such an amazing company.

50
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:36,380
No wonder you have such
an incredible gadget.

51
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:40,120
No, this Super Denshi randoseru
is still at the prototype stage,

52
00:02:40,170 --> 00:02:42,780
and I'm currently testing it.

53
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:45,020
Does it have any other functions?

54
00:02:45,660 --> 00:02:46,795
It's a trade secret, but

55
00:02:46,845 --> 00:02:50,140
well, as thanks for showing me the map,
I'll show you.

56
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,800
Alright, alright.

57
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,920
All the classes are

58
