You take pictures with
this and print them out.

59
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:11,860
48x zoom.

60
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,900
It's the smallest digital
camera in the world.

61
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,720
Wow, that's amazing!

62
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:19,580
