64
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,780
That's an included accessory, too.

65
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:33,140
Here is the weather
forecast for the Tokyo area.

66
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:35,380
First, the sky conditions.

67
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:39,360
Northerly winds,
later southwesterly winds, somewhat strong.

68
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,840
Leave the baby-making to me.

69
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,820
That's amazing!

70
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:46,440
With this flute,
you can control all electronic devices.

71
00:03:47,940 --> 00:03:49,600
Isn't music class tough?

72
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,940
with all sorts of switches getting
turned on by accident and such.

73
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:53,720
It's still a prototype, after all.

74
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,100
It's pretty heavy

75
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,400
It's to build up your body.

76
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:02,100
So they've thought about even that?

77
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:04,160
