satellite for communication.

99
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:15,120
And if you register your fingerprint, it'll sound an alarm
and lock up if anyone other than the owner picks it up.

100
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:17,180
Businessmen would probably want one.

101
00:05:17,180 --> 00:05:23,200
We plan to release it after the randoseru, and this
month we're recruiting test users at 50,000 yen.

102
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:25,880
50,000 yen, alright, I'll become one.

103
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,100
Really?

104
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,860
Leave it to me.

105
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:37,220
Senpai,
we haven't heard from you at all, have we?

106
00:05:37,220 --> 00:05:38,660
Let's just leave him be.

107
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,160
Ryo-chan's the type who

108
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:42,520
Senpai

109
00:05:44,460 --> 00:05:45,540
Hoyoyo

110
00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:47,560
What's with the "hoyoyo"?

111
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:50,620
He skipped three days without permission,
and the Chief is furious.

112
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,380
What's that?

113
00:05:53,060 --> 00:05:54,560
It's this thing's manual.

114
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,500
I've been studying it
for three days straight.

115
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,960
He's diligent when it comes
to anything other than work.

116
00:05:59,580 --> 00:06:04,180
Thanks to that, I've mastered everything from
digital camera shooting to using the internet.

117
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:07,620
I even opened a homepage, you know.

118
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,080
That's amazing for such a short time.

119
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:16,320
Plus, I begged the president
to add some new features.

120
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,320
You've become quite skilled, Ryo-chan.

121
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:21,380
It's the brain, you see.

122
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,540
